# Kỳ Này — build-time settings for apps/web (no secrets belong here; .env and .env.* are git-ignored).
# Set them in the shell, in the Cloudflare Pages project settings, or in apps/web/.env.local (Vite reads env files
# from apps/web/). See docs/evidence/M5-DESIGN-HANDOFF.md §3/§4 and ADR-0014.

# Optional link target for "Báo sai dữ liệu" (ADR-0014 point 4). Empty = copy-only report UI (default).
# Must be an absolute https: URL (http: only for localhost/127.0.0.1/[::1]), without user:password@, at most
# 2048 characters. An invalid value fails `vite build` (fail closed). The app opens it as-is and never appends
# report text, dataset IDs or notes to it.
VITE_REPORT_ISSUE_URL=

# Build identity (M5-A) is resolved automatically: commit from CF_PAGES_COMMIT_SHA / WORKERS_CI_COMMIT_SHA /
# GITHUB_SHA / `git rev-parse`; version from the root package.json. Set SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH (seconds) to pin the
# build time for a reproducible build.
# SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=
